1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Häradshövding.
2 CONT
2 CONT JONAS JUSTUS AURELL was born in 1654. He served as secretary of the province of Skaraborg. He was also inspector of a department of the postal service at Mariestad and justice in Wadsbo from 1695 to 1717. He married a daughter of 
2 CONC an eminent alderman in Stockholm. Both were buried in the State Church cemetery in Bjorsater. In the archives of the Royal Library at Stockholm are two documents printed in the artistic lettering in vogue those days. One is a eulo
2 CONC gy of this man written by a Bishop Ryzelius. The other is written in a poetical vein in honor of the wife at the time of their marriage indicating that they were a well known and esteemed couple.
2 CONT
