2 CONT Arvid Olofsson Drake (son of Olof Drake Tab. 2 ). Died around 1535. Fogde. Cavalry captain. Married 1: o 1533 with Brita Eriksdotter . Married 2: o with Brita Persdotter (Hard of Segerstad) , daughter of the warden Peder Hård and 
2 CONC Carin Tordsdotter ( Store ).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children in married 1: o with Brita Eriksdotter
2 CONT
2 CONT Märta Arvidsdotter, died in 1606. Married around 1550 with the foul Knut Håkansson ( Hand ).
2 CONT
2 CONT Children in married 2: o with Brita Persdotter (Hard of Segerstad)
2 CONT
2 CONT Agneta Arvidsdotter. Married before 1562 with the captain of Gullberg Peder Kijl .
