1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Catherina Lithenius=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Martinus Boetii Lithenius and Catharina Wallerius
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Åkerman was born 1729-11-17 in Stora Mellby (P) died 1771-01-17 in Katarina fs, Stockholm. He was a cantor and teacher (collega Scholae). Married 1758-07-13 in Katarina fs. to Maria Christina Broman, born about 1741, d 03-05
2 CONC -1798 in Katarina fs. She was the daughter of Olof Broman born about 1702 (according to Katarina DB 1771-01-07). He was a hawker and also had a tavern, no. 49. Her mother Christina Berg was born about 1710, 1763-08-13 in Katarina 
2 CONC fs. Stands as a Virgin at the wedding in 1738 in Katarina fs. Olof Broman's father, according to the marriage certificate and in the mother's estate register, was Per Månsson, tax farmer in Svärdbro, Sättersta sn (D) and the mothe
2 CONC r, Brita Olofsdotter, d 1745 in Stockholm. She remarried on 1721-12-03 in Jakob & Johannes fs, Sthlm, to the restaurateur Carl Berg, according to the marriage certificate he was from Nyland.
2 CONT Estate records are available for Olof Broman, Christina Berg, Brita Olofsdotter and Maria Christina Broman. (Sthlm's city archives)
2 CONT
2 CONT Johan Åkerman's father was the Church Priest in Stora Mellby, Lars Åkerman (1678 - 1748) and his mother was Catharina Lithenia b 1690 in Borås (dpt 25/5 ) died in 1741 in Stora Mellby.  
2 CONT
2 CONT Lars Åkerman's parents were Anders Nilsson Åkerman (1648 - 1703) customs administrator in Borås and Annika Larsdotter Wallman, d 1678.
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Lithenia was the daughter of the kykrcoherd and provost in Borås, Martin Lithenius (1638 - 1699) and Catharina Walleria, d 1690. He was son of Bo Bengtsson the parish priest in, among others, Stenstorps fs (P), d 1651 an
2 CONC d Christina Månsdotter d. 1680. Catharina Wallerius' parents were Daniel Larsson Wallerius (1638 - 1689), bishop of Gothenburg and Margareta Petersdotter Schomera. Their respective parents were Lars Eriksson Wallerius, ca 1602 - 1
2 CONC 662, provost in Högsby (H) and Catharina Ungia d.1643-05-01 and Petrus Andrae Schomerus, b 1607-06-25 in Uppsala, d 1660-02-07 in Kalmar, superintendent in Kalmar, and Margareta Henriksdotter (the couple married 1633-03-10).
2 CONT
2 CONT Catharina Ungia was the daughter of the superintendent in Kalmar Johannes Petri Ungius (1570 - 1617) and Helena Månsdotter, married in 1599.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
