2 CONT * '''Ingrid Månsdotter, Married to the '''horseman at Upplandsfanan (Blr.) Joen Andersson , ennobled Torskenstierna , but not introduced, to Hallsta in Björksta parish, Västmanland county, probably died in 1569. (Blr.)'''
2 CONT * '''Bengta Månsdotter,''' Married to the underling and war colonel Peder Nilsson , knighted Gyllenstråle (no. 256), who lived in 1587.'''
2 CONT * '''Anders Månsson,''' died young.
