1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Hans (Befritz, pronounced Beverage, "Bevv-ritj") Belfrage, born 1614 in Scotland, came 1624 to Sweden. DNA verified via at least two sons, belonging to YDNA haplogroup R1b1a1a2a1a2c1c (FGC11134).
