2 CONT * [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Silfversw%C3%A4rd_nr_184 '''Karin Lennartsdotter Svenske'''] died 1678-01 and is buried in the church of Kvän. Married 1: o 1629 with senior Lieutenant Lars Larsson the elder, Silfverswärd N
2 CONC o. 184 , in his 2nd marriage married. Married 2: o 1648 with the major Håkan Larsson, escorted Svärdsköld no. 334 , in his 2nd marriage.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579543&photo_id=6000000190352041878&position=1 '''Margareta Lennartsdotter Svenske'''] Married to Major Carl Jönsson Svinhufvud in Västergötland No. 199, Son of Jöns D
2 CONC anielsson Svinhufvud, till Framby and Christina Larsdotter von Köllen.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://start.varmlandsrotter.se/varmlandsanor/artiklar/2014_2/ '''Anders Cavalry captain.'''] Death 1671, to Östbro, Mellbyn and Ölserud as well as Tolerud and Kyrkbyn. Cavalry captain. Lived 1671-02-04, but was dead on 7/9. M
2 CONC arried to Estrid Hård , daughter of County Chief Claes Knutsson ( Hård af Torestorp no. 60 ) and his 1st wife Margareta Bengtsdotter ( Lilliestielke no. 120 ). He grew up with his mother and four sisters on the estates Mällbyn in 
2 CONC Bro and Säter in Eskilsäter. The father, Lennart Pedersson Svenske, died in 1618, when Anders was only five or six years old. His mother, Elin Jakobsdotter, owned 17 homesteads in addition to the estates at the time of her husband
2 CONC 's death. And there was more through inheritance from aunt Margareta. She also expanded her domains through her own acquisitions. And Anders initially followed 
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/4579386?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000191472281854 '''Agneta Lennartsdotter Svenske'''] Born 1617, died in 1688. Married to Colonel Lieutenant Patrik Thomson, No. 299.
2 CONT
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view/4579386?album_type=photos_of_me&photo_id=6000000191472281854  '''Brita Lennartsdotter Svenske,'''] lived in 1688. Married 1st in 1635 with the rider Lars Silfverswärd nr 184 . Married 2: o 1647 w
2 CONC ith Major Jöns Lilliebielke nr 273. JftM (son of Henric, Tab. 3), to Djupsås; b. 1621 ; Kornett at Westgötha Cavall. 1650; Finally, 1673, Major Lars Silfverswärd.; born 1696. He treated his wife badly and committed murder on Capta
2 CONC in Roscnsköld's servant, for which he escaped from the kingdom. Married in 1647 to Brita Swedish, in her 2nd marriage; daughter of Ryttmästaren Lennart Pcdersson Svenske (No. 258), to Sätra, with Elin Bååt, No. 3, as well as widow
2 CONC  of Executive Lieutenant Lars Silfversvärd, Njo 184, to Kirfvinge, Kilsbyn and Sätra. 
