1 OCCU Dalafogde, Fogde, Till Främmanby och Lilljan Torsånger. "Svinhufvud" i Västergötland och fogde i Östra Dalarna. På Uppsala möte 1593, Fogde och Konungens befallningsman över Dalarna, Fogede
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Jöns Danielsson Svinhufvud=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Daniel Torkelsson Svinhufvud, till Främmandeby and Anna Margaretha Jönsdotter Scrifvare, af Qvalstad 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579787&photo_id=6000000190254258905&position=0 '''Jöns Danielsson Svinhufvud History from Med Dalälven Från Källorna Till Havet Del III Bok 3 Sundborn by Karl Erik For
2 CONC sslund, page 174''']
2 CONT * Jons Danielsson to Främby. Brought to arms a dark gray Svinhufvud in a RÖDT field. Was bailiff on the copper Mount 1598; The commanding man upon East-and Wester Dal Arne 1606, and Alled 4613
2 CONT * Was conferred on 2 January 1595 with Kronohemmanet Lily in Thorsång; became by Kongl. 
2 CONT * Brefvet on 1 January 1608 freed from all Afrad and tenth-copper of their cabs, receiving Duty to keep the horse and the man in time of war; Behind by the same bref donation on the Kronohemma-nen wage moss, Gräfningen, Klubbetägt
2 CONC en and Lily, against the connection that for them keep 2 horses and 2 men. Bought on 10 November 1589 the property Bölet in Wika Parish for 46 Daler and Four Skeppund Råkoppar, host 92 Daler, which property, Jemte a hall copper-fo
2 CONC rge, the Sunna about Falan, near the German hut, he on November 1, 4596 GAF tomorrow-Gåfva to his wife Christina Lars's daughter of Täckåker, who in his arms brought four bullets between Tvänne crossed Bilor, and Lefde Enka yet 16
2 CONC 41. (See the referenced K. B. Jemte an AF on 8 Nov. 1613, as well as S. A. M. P. 302.) 
2 CONT * [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579787&photo_id=6000000220201816829&position=0 '''Family Geneology Chart of "Jöns Danielsson, till Främby"''']
2 CONT *  [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579755&photo_id=6000000190208371839&position=0 '''Medieval stained glass with the boar's head coat of arms in Torsång's church, Dalarna, now in the Historical Museum,
2 CONC  Stockholm. Photo: Riksantikvarieämbetet''']
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: [https://www.geni.com/photo/view?album_type=photos_of_me&id=4579787&photo_id=6000000190351884872&position=0 '''Christina Larsdotter von Köllen,'''] daughter of Lars von Köllen.  Gave morning gift 1596-11-01, with Christ
2 CONC ina Larsdotter von Köllen to Täckeråker in Österhaninge, lived widow 1641. She carried in the weapon [Two cars crossed between four bullets] . She kept a will between her and the children in 1616 and pledged Främby to the chamber 
2 CONC councilor Bror Andersson Rålamb . Certainly a daughter of the captain, knight chief and owner of Täckåker Lars von Köllen born probably in Täckåker, Östehaninge sn, † 1577 in Reval. His family probably came from Germany.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Brita Jönsdotter Svinhufvud,''' married (1) Peder Brita, married  (2) Hansson Framby, son of Olof Goransson
2 CONT * '''Anna Jönsdotter Svinhufvud,''' married  (1) Lansmannen Tuna, married (2) Erik Svensson
2 CONT *''' Major Carl Jönsson Svinhuvud,''' to Stora Dingelvik in Steneby parish on Dal; born in the 1580s; Presented his grandfather's letter of nobility and was introduced under No. 199 in 1633, and the family has since been named Svi
2 CONC nhufund in Westergöthland; Häradshöfding in Skärkinds härad in Östergöthland  in 1635, according to Åkerstein; Was in 1636 Major at Nerike and Wermland's reg:te. He received in 1649 on 20 Oct. as a donation six tax homes in Konga 
2 CONC county in Småland. — Married to Margaretha Svenske; daughter of Ryttmästaren Lennart Pedersson Svenske, No. 258, to Sätra, with Elin Bååt (No. 3). 
2 CONT * '''Goran Jönsson Svinhufvud,''' Ship Captain 1600; Horsemaster at Up-Jabd's horsemen in 1612; Major of the home war-people of KinJand, what he was in lying r; Called 163a, at Akerstein, Kommcodant. Appears in the Riddarhus proto
2 CONC col for the year 1633, as follows rande, but out of date, as well as unrepentant of Adel. He bought 1013 from his mother Täckaker, which he Married in Finland to Anna Sabbel; daughter of Lindred Classon (Sabelfans, Nio 188), to Öf
2 CONC verby, med Anna Fransdotter Sohade.
2 CONT * '''Lars Jönsson Svinhufvud,''' born 1586; Lived without  service; † unmarried in 1666 at Bogesund, acc. the inscription on his coat of arms, which was set up in Waxholm's church, where he is buried. 
2 CONT * '''Cornelius Jönsson Svinhufvud,''' Ensign in the Dal Reg:tet. Was in the Polish War — Married to a farmer's daughter from Stora Tuna in Dalarne. 
2 CONT * '''Daniel Jönsson Svinhufvud,''' Captain 1633; † 1642, probably childless. — Married to Lucia Peders daughter Gria, who survived him.
2 CONT * '''Margareta Jönsdotter Svinhufvud,''' Married to Lars Jacobsson in Ljusdal.
2 CONT
