1 NAME Axel Ludvig /Molin/
2 GIVN Axel Ludvig
2 _MARNM Molin
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 17 FEB 1805
2 ADDR
3 STAE (M)
3 CTRY Sweden
